cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "proxymix: KL-Optimal Gaussian Mixture Proxies for Arbitrary Target Densities"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Max
    family-names: Moldovan
    email: max.moldovan@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9680-8474"
abstract: >-
  An R package fitting multivariate Gaussian-mixture proxies that are
  Kullback-Leibler optimal to user-supplied target densities. Three regimes
  are unified under one verb: closed-form moment matching, classical EM on
  samples, and importance-sampled KLD-EM against an evaluable-only target.
license: MIT
